  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWPF with ProGPU preview.21; packages architecture-specific Windows DirectWrite PresentationCore runtimes for visible stock-Windows text while retaining the portable ProGPU renderer on macOS and Linux; adds a Windows package smoke that rejects blank TextBlock output; settles native popup placement after layout for WPF Gallery and SharpDevelop menus; preserves hosted double-click input, high-DPI logical sizing, native title chrome, resize-time rendering, text selection, keyboard shortcuts, and safe drag selection; and retains bounded GPU memory and glyph-atlas scrolling performance.",
